#: Game.Levels.GCD.L09_gcd_shift
msgid "**Shift Invariance of the GCD**\n"
"\n"
"For any integers §0, and non-negative gcd-witnesses §1:\n"
"if §2 and §3, then §4.\n"
"\n"
"**Why this matters:**\n"
"This is the *engine* of the Euclidean Algorithm for computing GCDs: §5 for any integer §6. In particular, replacing §7 by its remainder after dividing by §8 never changes the GCD with §9 — which is exactly what lets the Euclidean Algorithm shrink its numbers step by step until it reaches the answer."
msgstr ""

